/d/14NfbBBFcs9UJGpiUVYjW6g24z6CvKMLn/view?usp=drivesdk"&gt;保存した写真&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;確認：2026-11-13／訪問日の料金・営業は再確認&lt;br&gt;写真：Kent Wang from Barcelona, Spain／CC BY-SA 2.0&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Libreria_Acqua_Alta_%2850444321282%29.jpg"&gt;写真の出典&lt;/a&gt;・&lt;a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0"&gt;利用条件&lt;/a&gt;</description><styleUrl>#icon-1899-0F9D58</styleUrl><ExtendedData><Data name="gx_media_links"><value>https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Libreria_Acqua_Alta_%2850444321282%29.jpg/1280px-Libreria_Acqua_Alta_%2850444321282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=imageinfo&amp;utm_content=thumbnail</value></Data></ExtendedData><Point><coordinates>12.34228,45.43798,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>